|Step 2: SigLIP 2 Multi-Task|

:Load SigLIP 2 NAFlex Backbone (Frozen);
note right
  **models/siglip2_multitask.py**
  LOC: TBD

  **Architecture**:
  - SigLIP 2 NAFlex ViT-B/16
  - ~88M params (backbone frozen)
  - 22 task heads across 5 groups:
    G1: IQA (6 heads: blur/noise/contrast/skew/compression + overall_quality)
    G2: Script (3 heads: script_code cls + has_non_latin + has_rtl)
    G3: Orientation+Skew (3 heads: orientation_cls + skew_reg + confidence)
    G4: Handwriting (5 heads: 3 cls presence/legibility/content_type + 2 reg scores)
    G5: Page Attrs (5 heads: capture_cls + shadow/warping/code/resolution_quality reg)

  **Variable resolution via NAFlex packing**
  (no downsampling required)
end note

:Configure SigLIP 2 Multi-Task Training;
note left
  **training/siglip2_trainer.py**
  LOC: TBD

  **Training Config**:
  - Optimizer: AdamW
  - LR schedule: CosineAnnealing
  - Loss: Weighted multi-task
    (per-group weights)
  - Epochs: 30
  - Batch size: 64
  - Backbone: FROZEN
end note

:Run SigLIP 2 Multi-Task Training (Modal GPU);
note right
  **modal/train_siglip2_multitask.py**
  LOC: TBD

  **Modal Config**:
  - GPU: A10
  - All 10 datasets (~503K)
  - Duration: ~17.5 hours
  - Checkpointing: Every 3 epochs
end note

:Save SigLIP 2 Multi-Task Checkpoint;
note left
  **Graduation Thresholds (Step 2)**:
  - IQA VQualA >= 0.92 (DIQA-5000 test)
  - Script overall acc >= 90% (MLT19 + held-out MDIW13)
  - Script Tibetan acc (real only) >= 80% (5-fold CV)
  - Orientation acc >= 95% (orientation test set)
  - Orientation vertical Japanese >= 95% as 0-degree
  - Skew MAE < 0.5 deg; >= 90% within 0.5 deg of GT
  - Handwriting presence acc >= 88% (HierText val)
  - Handwriting legibility acc >= 85% (HierText val)
  - Capture method acc >= 85% (RVL-CDIP val)
  - Shadow/warping MAE < 0.08 (Doc3D val)
  - Resolution quality MAE < 0.1
end note

|Step 3: MobileNetV4 Distillation|

:Generate SigLIP 2 Soft Labels;
note right
  **training/generate_soft_labels.py**
  LOC: TBD

  **Process**:
  - Load SigLIP 2 checkpoint
  - Run inference on training data
  - Extract Groups 3+5 outputs
    (orientation, skew, resolution)
  - Save soft predictions
  - Temperature scaling (T=3)
end note

:Configure MobileNetV4 Distillation;
note left
  **training/mobilenetv4_trainer.py**
  (distillation mode)

  **Training Config**:
  - KL-divergence distillation
  - Alpha: 0.7 (SigLIP 2 weight)
  - Temperature: 3.0
  - Epochs: 20
  - Batch size: 256
end note

:Run MobileNetV4 Distillation (Modal GPU);
note right
  **modal/train_mobilenetv4.py**
  (distillation mode)

  **Modal Config**:
  - GPU: A10
  - Uses SigLIP 2 soft labels
  - Duration: ~1.7 hours
  - Faster than bootstrap
end note

:Save MobileNetV4 Distilled Checkpoint;
note left
  **Improved Thresholds (Step 3)**:
  - Orientation acc > 98%
    (was 95% in Step 1)
  - Skew MAE < 0.3 deg
    (was 0.5 in Step 1)
end note

